#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Demand-capped replay of recorded multi-start assignments.

No search output is changed or regenerated.  Recorded endpoint and recorded
F-best swap assignments are evaluated on the immutable world tapes.  An
in-memory source transformation adds a read-only callback to the exact dense
evaluator after each rational subslot's delivered rate has been computed.
"""

